Skill `expo-overview`.
Roles: `agent`, `user`.
Tool `read_package_json` (owner `agent`): via `read`; adds `package_json_checked`.
Tool `read_project_config` (owner `agent`): via `read`; requires `is_expo_or_eas_work`; adds `sdk_checked`, `project_shape_checked`.
Tool `read_leaf_skill` (owner `agent`): via `skill`; requires `leaf_skill_chosen`; adds `leaf_skill_loaded`.
Tool `ask_intent` (owner `agent`): via `ask_user`; requires `is_expo_or_eas_work`; adds `intent_confirmed`.
Tool `reply_route` (owner `agent`): via `reply`; requires `is_expo_or_eas_work` and `leaf_skill_loaded`; adds `routed_with_shared_rules`.
Initially true: none.
Goal: `routed_with_shared_rules`.
Protocol:
  - `agent` chooses one of (observed):
    - branch `request_mentions_expo_or_eas` (assuming `is_expo_or_eas_work`): none.
    - branch `request_unclear_check_project`:
      - `agent` uses `read_package_json`.
      - `agent` chooses one of (observed):
        - branch `expo_dependency_found` (assuming `is_expo_or_eas_work`): none.
        - branch `no_expo_signal`: none.
  - `agent` chooses one of (observed):
    - branch `specific_leaf_skill_named` (assuming `leaf_skill_chosen`):
      - `agent` uses `read_leaf_skill`.
      - `agent` uses `reply_route`.
    - branch `route_by_goal`:
      - `agent` chooses one of (observed):
        - branch `goal_ambiguous`:
          - `agent` uses `ask_intent`.
        - branch `goal_clear`: none.
      - `agent` uses `read_project_config`.
      - `agent` chooses one of (observed):
        - branch `build_app_goal` (assuming `leaf_skill_chosen`):
          - `agent` uses `read_leaf_skill`.
        - branch `ship_or_operate_goal` (assuming `leaf_skill_chosen`):
          - `agent` uses `read_leaf_skill`.
        - branch `extend_natively_goal` (assuming `leaf_skill_chosen`):
          - `agent` uses `read_leaf_skill`.
        - branch `maintain_or_learn_goal` (assuming `leaf_skill_chosen`):
          - `agent` uses `read_leaf_skill`.
      - `agent` uses `reply_route`.
